BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:✈️ 🏁 Dakar Rally 2027 (Portugal → Morocco)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270124
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:52d660e036f8c93de293@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Motorsport
DESCRIPTION:Dakar returns to Africa for the first time since 2008\, from t
 he Algarve to Marrakech by way of a Mediterranean night crossing. 7\,824 k
 m\, 4\,341 km of special stages\, six bivouacs. After driving to Kazakhsta
 n\, you'll know exactly how they feel.\n\nStatus: ✅ Confirmed\nMoved fro
 m Saudi Arabia late in the day. Dates are pending final FIA World Motor Sp
 ort Council approval.\n✈️ Trip-worthy: there's a booking nudge in the 
 📅 Booking Nudges feed ~3 months ahead.\nOfficial info: https://www.daka
 r.com
GEO:31.6295;-7.9811
LOCATION:Loulé-Faro\, Portugal → Marrakech\, Morocco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.dakar.com
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE="Loulé-F
 aro, Portugal → Marrakech, Morocco":geo:31.6295,-7.9811
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Booking nudge: Dakar Rally 2027 (Portugal → Morocco) is ~3 m
 onths away
TRIGGER:-P90D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
